% oracle: colour
% Scenario: the XYZ space. A CIEBasedABC space with only its white point
% and the ranges the tristimulus components take is carried as a CalRGB
% space with unit gammas and the identity matrix.
[/CIEBasedABC <<
  /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089]
  /RangeABC [0 0.9505 0 1 0 1]
  /RangeLMN [0 0.9505 0 1 0 1]
>>] setcolorspace
0.5 0.6 0.7 setcolor
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
